stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CollectData
  CollectData: Collect telemetry and acknowledgements
  Analyse: Ask the configured model for a verdict
  DecideAction: Validate severity and select next action
  Notify: Send high or critical notification

  CollectData --> Analyse: Evidence available
  Analyse --> DecideAction: Structured verdict
  DecideAction --> Notify: High or critical
  DecideAction --> [*]: OK or warning
  Notify --> [*]: Delivery attempted
